        "x1": 205.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 moves in a destructive way"
      },
      {
        "y": 561,
        "x0": 341.3,
        "x1": 419.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "speaking or writing."
      },
      {
        "y": 571.8,
        "x0": 75,
        "x1": 205.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "C Playing with words"
      },
      {
        "y": 589.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 510.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Many newspaper headlines attract readers’ attention by playing on words in an entertaining way. For"
      },
      {
        "y": 601.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 508,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "example, a story about a very heavy rainstorm which caused a landslide on a narrow mountain road"
      },
      {
        "y": 613.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 500.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "was headlined Rain of terror. This headline was a play on words based on the expression reign of"
      },
      {
        "y": 625.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 508.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "terror, an expression used about a period in which a country’s ruler controls people in a particularly"
      },
      {
        "y": 637.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 140.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "cruel way."
      },
      {
        "y": 649.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 495.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Another example is the use of the headline Moon becomes shooting star to describe a football"
      },
      {
        "y": 661.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 513.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "match where a player called John Moon shot [scored] the winning goal. Shooting star is an informal"
      },
      {
        "y": 673.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 518.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "expression for a meteor. Here it is used to play on the expression shoot a goal, and also to link to the"
      },
      {
        "y": 685.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 510.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "player’s name, Moon (another astronomical body). The headline is particularly effective because of"
      },
      {
        "y": 697.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 308.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the association between star and moon in the sky."
      }
